WEBVTT

00:03.470 --> 00:05.230
Oh, are you hungry?

00:09.740 --> 00:11.559
All right, just a sec.

00:11.560 --> 00:13.250
I'll open it for you.

00:17.170 --> 00:18.939
Tooru, what's wrong?

00:18.940 --> 00:20.629
You don't look so good.

00:20.630 --> 00:23.210
I just had a really weird dream.

00:23.040 --> 00:23.078
LIVE-EVIL FANSUBS Presents

00:26.290 --> 00:28.730
Hori-san to Miyamura-kun starts now!

00:34.120 --> 00:36.200
These will be on the midterm, too.

00:37.200 --> 00:38.030
They'll be on there.

00:38.031 --> 00:41.760
Hey, Hori, English
might just be my specialty.

00:42.260 --> 00:45.659
You only scored above-average, right?

00:45.660 --> 00:48.639
Don't be silly. I've simply
been hiding my talents is all.

00:48.640 --> 00:49.780
That's stupid.

00:53.040 --> 00:54.040
Miyamura.

00:54.820 --> 00:55.960
What'd you get?

00:56.550 --> 00:57.930
Did you beat the average?

00:59.780 --> 01:00.800
I won.

01:01.420 --> 01:04.880
Aren't quiet people who wear
glasses normally good at studying?

01:05.490 --> 01:06.630
Really?

01:07.300 --> 01:08.300
And you?

01:09.280 --> 01:10.930
I don't really...

01:13.600 --> 01:15.469
That's amazing.

01:15.470 --> 01:17.439
As expected from Hori.

01:17.440 --> 01:19.999
The questions were all
things he said to review.

01:20.000 --> 01:21.910
Make sure you look these over.

01:23.320 --> 01:24.369
You too, Miyamura.

01:24.370 --> 01:25.690
Me too?

01:26.000 --> 01:27.240
I'll check it for you.

01:27.530 --> 01:29.599
Hori, me too! Me too!

01:29.600 --> 01:32.240
I'll check everyone's this time.

01:38.530 --> 01:39.659
Heading home?

01:39.660 --> 01:41.240
Wanna go to McDonalds?

01:42.800 --> 01:43.850
Sorry, heading home.

01:44.400 --> 01:45.000
OK.

01:45.001 --> 01:46.140
Bye-bye.

01:53.200 --> 01:55.549
Hori-san, there might be a limited-time sa-

01:55.550 --> 01:56.560
Shhh!

01:57.040 --> 01:58.040
Can I come?

02:03.750 --> 02:05.709
Thanks for the help.

02:05.710 --> 02:08.040
You only buy the essentials.

02:18.750 --> 02:19.700
Hori-san, um...

02:19.701 --> 02:22.249
<i>Miyamura doesn't like me
walking too close to the street.</i>

02:22.250 --> 02:23.840
<i>But, he does it all the time.</i>

02:23.841 --> 02:25.879
Do you usually do all
your shopping like this?

02:25.880 --> 02:28.069
<i>He's always by my side.</i>

02:28.070 --> 02:29.370
<i>By my side...</i>

02:36.420 --> 02:38.440
A welcome party for new students?

02:39.240 --> 02:40.799
The student council asked me to help.

02:40.800 --> 02:43.800
Being an honor student sure sounds tough.

02:44.290 --> 02:46.060
What's an honor student?

02:47.200 --> 02:50.139
It's someone who the
teachers and students can trust,

02:50.140 --> 02:54.499
a person who is smart, capable,
efficient, and a genuine bookworm.

02:54.500 --> 02:56.620
In other words, someone
who works hard at everything.

02:56.850 --> 02:58.370
Hey, that's saying a bit much.

02:58.790 --> 03:00.510
Can they shoot laser beams from their eyes?

03:00.620 --> 03:01.630
If they try.

03:02.110 --> 03:03.579
No they can't.

03:03.580 --> 03:06.679
Anyway, if I'm helping,
then I'm going to do it right.

03:06.680 --> 03:09.180
I don't want to be a burden.

03:10.260 --> 03:12.220
You sure have a strong
sense of responsibility.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.480
What's a sense of responsibility?

03:14.950 --> 03:18.230
Um... It means that once they
start something, they finish it.

03:18.590 --> 03:20.460
I still can't shoot beams.

03:21.440 --> 03:24.880
I want to help, but I'd
probably be just a bother.

03:26.460 --> 03:29.349
A tad pessimistic, but
you're probably right.

03:29.350 --> 03:31.990
Well if you need any
shopping done, leave it to me.

03:33.400 --> 03:34.570
OK.

03:38.540 --> 03:39.579
Yo.

03:39.580 --> 03:40.940
Can I join you?

03:41.420 --> 03:42.610
Sure.

03:44.540 --> 03:46.480
What do I do with this?

03:45.071 --> 03:46.489
Career Path Questionnaire

03:48.190 --> 03:50.249
You still haven't turned that in?

03:50.250 --> 03:52.760
Ah! I haven't either.

03:53.450 --> 03:55.950
I don't really have a preference.

03:56.580 --> 03:59.930
But this is just used for
the mock exam, right?

04:00.520 --> 04:02.550
So it doesn't matter what you write?

04:03.970 --> 04:05.200
Toudai!

04:05.870 --> 04:07.150
Kyoudai!

04:07.820 --> 04:09.280
Those are both E-ranked schools.

04:12.320 --> 04:14.190
Have you turned it in, Hori?

04:15.110 --> 04:16.110
Not yet.

04:16.610 --> 04:17.760
Aiming for Toudai?

04:18.370 --> 04:20.020
As if.

04:21.040 --> 04:22.240
Hori-san.

04:26.450 --> 04:28.570
Sorry to bug you during lunch.

04:29.090 --> 04:30.130
It's fine.

04:30.640 --> 04:32.560
Will it be all right to
have second-years there?

04:35.340 --> 04:36.840
I made my own lunch.

04:37.340 --> 04:38.320
Doesn't it look good?

04:38.321 --> 04:40.420
Hey, is Ohno-san around?

04:40.680 --> 04:41.680
What's that?

04:42.130 --> 04:44.170
He's in the next class over, I think.

04:43.600 --> 04:45.250
That doesn't look very good.

04:45.060 --> 04:46.870
I see. Thanks.

04:56.190 --> 04:57.690
Eggs are half-off until 4pm!

04:57.691 --> 04:59.190
Sender: Hori Kyouko

04:57.691 --> 04:59.190
Subject: Supermarket

04:59.750 --> 05:01.230
Until four...

05:02.550 --> 05:04.700
She wants me to go buy them?!

05:08.240 --> 05:09.240
<i>I only have ten minutes.</i>

05:11.330 --> 05:13.700
<i>This is the shortest
way to the supermarket.</i>

05:16.220 --> 05:17.990
<i>Lucky me! Looks like no one's here.</i>

05:20.400 --> 05:21.970
<i>Now to just jump the fence!</i>

05:24.130 --> 05:25.960
Sorry, but the eggs are...

05:27.530 --> 05:30.600
I'm surprised to see someone
like that attending school.

05:32.590 --> 05:35.010
I wonder if he plans on laying those eggs?

05:37.520 --> 05:41.519
Student Council Room

05:37.840 --> 05:39.029
You're a lifesaver.

05:39.030 --> 05:41.630
Looks like having someone smart
to do this was the best approach.

05:42.210 --> 05:43.440
Really?

05:44.440 --> 05:47.530
Sorry to ask, but could you do these too?

05:47.800 --> 05:49.789
Huh? Sengoku-

05:49.790 --> 05:51.090
Kun!

05:52.880 --> 05:54.850
We're counting on you, Hori-san.

05:55.440 --> 05:58.880
I guess so... Sengoku-kun...

06:04.800 --> 06:06.439
I'm home.

06:06.440 --> 06:08.860
Sorry, Souta, I'll start dinner now.

06:10.970 --> 06:11.970
Welcome home.

06:13.360 --> 06:15.260
It'll be done in just a little bit.

06:17.340 --> 06:18.510
Why...?

06:19.060 --> 06:20.370
- Thanks for the food!
- Thanks for the food!

06:21.660 --> 06:22.750
Thanks for the food.

06:26.800 --> 06:28.110
Delicious.

06:34.530 --> 06:35.570
What?

06:36.090 --> 06:38.829
I bumped into someone
on the way to the store.

06:38.830 --> 06:40.030
Who?

06:40.540 --> 06:42.119
Yoshikawa-san.

06:42.120 --> 06:44.530
Yuki? Don't you see her every day?

06:45.200 --> 06:47.890
No, I mean she <i>saw</i> me.

06:49.980 --> 06:52.359
Er... well it was just by accident.

06:52.360 --> 06:54.880
I didn't talk to her or anything.

06:56.620 --> 07:04.370
I see... I kind of wanted
nobody else to see you that way...

07:06.080 --> 07:07.650
Sorry. It doesn't matter.

07:08.120 --> 07:09.299
Want some barley tea?

07:09.300 --> 07:10.330
I do!

07:20.040 --> 07:21.309
Hori-san...

07:21.310 --> 07:22.559
Um...

07:22.560 --> 07:27.869
Your appearance, the way you cook...

07:27.870 --> 07:30.770
The way you raise your
voice when you're angry...

07:31.500 --> 07:35.169
The way you don't care about
your hair when you're home...

07:35.170 --> 07:37.359
And well... um...

07:37.360 --> 07:39.379
That you have good muscles...

07:39.380 --> 07:40.480
What was that?

07:40.900 --> 07:45.189
I also kind of want nobody
else to see you this way.

07:45.190 --> 07:47.329
Well, I agree.

07:47.330 --> 07:52.090
It feels like this time
of day is just for me.

07:54.240 --> 07:57.359
Q-Quit spouting nonsense.

07:57.360 --> 07:58.870
God, you're stupid.

07:59.220 --> 08:00.220
Stupid, huh?

08:01.800 --> 08:03.819
Yes. Stupid. Very stupid.

08:03.820 --> 08:05.370
You're stupid, Miyamura.

08:13.350 --> 08:16.480
Isn't it OK for him to live here?

08:17.040 --> 08:18.969
There's no way.

08:18.970 --> 08:21.790
We can't depend on him forever.

08:22.690 --> 08:25.030
Is he going to stop coming?

08:26.080 --> 08:27.610
Eventually he will...

08:28.140 --> 08:29.869
After we graduate from high school.

08:29.870 --> 08:32.490
He's going to stop
coming after graduation?!

08:34.680 --> 08:38.110
Miyamura has his own future to worry about.

08:38.720 --> 08:40.619
And that doesn't bother you?!

08:40.620 --> 08:43.370
I don't want him to stop coming!

08:43.820 --> 08:45.390
I-I don't want him to either!

08:50.440 --> 08:54.080
Souta is able to speak
his mind so openly...

08:54.800 --> 08:57.360
And yet I can't...

09:02.860 --> 09:04.400
He looks just like him.

09:04.880 --> 09:05.980
Oh, no!

09:07.110 --> 09:10.919
He looks just like the black power
ranger that's on in the morning.

09:10.920 --> 09:13.259
Ah! Y-Yeah, that's right!

09:13.260 --> 09:15.030
I get that a lot.

09:16.040 --> 09:17.780
Do his catchphrase.

09:18.590 --> 09:21.299
U-Um... uh...

09:21.300 --> 09:24.410
I shall protect the peace of Edo.

09:24.650 --> 09:26.180
That was just like him!

09:26.181 --> 09:27.470
Nice, Tooru.

09:27.100 --> 09:27.840
Really?

09:27.820 --> 09:30.320
Yeah. Do it one more time.

09:27.841 --> 09:30.330
I didn't think <i>you'd</i> watch Power Rangers.

09:30.960 --> 09:31.760
I shall!

09:31.760 --> 09:33.009
Again, again!

09:31.761 --> 09:33.030
Yes, I like it.

09:33.010 --> 09:34.010
I shall!

09:39.580 --> 09:41.350
Hori! You look like a bear.

09:42.330 --> 09:43.480
No way.

09:44.030 --> 09:46.040
Didn't you finish your work already?

09:46.810 --> 09:49.029
They asked me to help some more.

09:49.030 --> 09:52.999
Eh? Aren't they just using you, Hori?

09:53.000 --> 09:56.370
Even so, I don't really
mind so long as I'm useful.

10:01.940 --> 10:07.630
I guess since we're idiots, there's
not much we can do to help...

10:08.510 --> 10:12.969
Actually, I scored higher
than you did on the last test.

10:12.970 --> 10:16.389
What are you talking
about? It's just health class.

10:16.390 --> 10:20.560
Sengoku, the class president
had the highest score.

10:21.260 --> 10:22.999
He's popular with the girls too.

10:23.000 --> 10:25.770
It's possible Hori-san
is also interested in him.

10:26.700 --> 10:29.440
Hori, what is more important
to you, health class or P.E.?

10:29.980 --> 10:31.970
Common sense.

10:38.991 --> 10:43.199
I messed up...

10:40.070 --> 10:41.630
I messed up...

10:45.350 --> 10:47.670
Huh? Sengoku has a girlfriend?

10:48.030 --> 10:50.699
Yeah. A real cutie.

10:50.700 --> 10:54.639
She's in the student council
too, but doesn't do much.

10:54.640 --> 10:57.940
Yeah, she's sort of a mascot.

10:58.630 --> 11:01.810
So does that mean they're
making Hori do all her work?

11:02.370 --> 11:03.939
Isn't that messed up?

11:03.940 --> 11:06.930
Well, I'm the one who agreed to do it.

11:11.660 --> 11:12.999
What should we drink?

11:13.000 --> 11:15.119
I'm not sure.

11:15.120 --> 11:17.439
Hey, if you're not buying
anything, then move.

11:17.440 --> 11:18.760
Sorry.

11:20.700 --> 11:23.759
Hey, Sengoku-kun, I want lemon tea.

11:23.760 --> 11:24.889
I'll have the same.

11:24.890 --> 11:25.950
Huh?

11:26.340 --> 11:28.170
Then, let's share it.

11:28.970 --> 11:31.139
You weren't kidding, right?

11:31.140 --> 11:33.920
That you'll take care of my mistakes.

11:35.250 --> 11:38.099
Yeah. Anything for you, Remi.

11:38.100 --> 11:41.920
I'll explain to everyone that
you haven't made any mistakes.

11:42.470 --> 11:44.510
I'm so happy! Thanks a lot!

11:45.370 --> 11:46.620
Um...

11:47.360 --> 11:48.709
What do you want?

11:48.710 --> 11:50.300
Did you need something?

11:51.390 --> 11:54.560
Could you move over a little bit, please.

12:03.910 --> 12:05.989
You get to go home early today.

12:05.990 --> 12:06.990
Isn't that great?

12:07.390 --> 12:09.359
No, it isn't.

12:09.360 --> 12:13.679
Souta said he's bringing a
girl over, so I have to clean.

12:13.680 --> 12:16.540
Ah! I need to get some
juice and snacks, too!

12:17.370 --> 12:20.170
Hori-san, do you still have some eggs?

12:26.030 --> 12:28.360
Wow! It looks just like
the bread in the stores.

12:29.790 --> 12:32.140
He works at a bakery, you know?

12:33.860 --> 12:34.870
Well, my parents do.

12:38.190 --> 12:41.250
After graduation, I think I'm
going to help at my family's shop.

12:42.020 --> 12:43.840
Eh? That's great.

12:44.490 --> 12:46.110
I'll just be an apprentice though.

12:46.420 --> 12:51.120
Still, it sounds nice to be
able to do something you like.

12:54.250 --> 12:59.230
All I ever do is study, so I
don't really know what that's like.

13:00.730 --> 13:03.469
Would you mind getting me a scrunchy?

13:03.470 --> 13:05.109
There's probably one on top of my desk.

13:05.110 --> 13:06.579
In your room?

13:06.580 --> 13:07.580
Yeah.

13:09.840 --> 13:11.300
OK, here goes.

13:18.810 --> 13:20.065
Career Path

13:18.810 --> 13:21.320
- ( 1 ) After graduation, I plan to (circle one)
- Higher Education Work Other

13:18.810 --> 13:21.320
- ( 2 ) Preferred Schools (Write your top three)
- 1st choice

13:18.810 --> 13:20.065
2nd choice

13:18.810 --> 13:20.065
School Name

13:18.810 --> 13:21.320
- Comments - ( 3 ) Occupation
aspiration (Enter only prospective careers)

13:20.066 --> 13:21.320
Questionnaire

13:20.066 --> 13:21.320
3rd choice

13:20.066 --> 13:21.320
Field of study

13:22.990 --> 13:26.619
Wow, this is pretty wrinkled.

13:26.620 --> 13:28.370
Maybe she almost accidentally threw it out.

13:28.370 --> 13:31.580
- - ( 1 ) After graduation,
I plan to (circle one)

13:28.370 --> 13:31.580
- Higher Education Work Other - ( 2 )
Preferred Schools (Write your top three)

13:28.370 --> 13:29.975
1st choice

13:28.370 --> 13:29.975
3rd choice

13:28.370 --> 13:29.975
Field of study

13:28.370 --> 13:31.580
- ( 3 ) Occupation aspiration (Enter only prospective careers)
- 1st choice

13:28.370 --> 13:29.975
2nd choice

13:28.370 --> 13:31.580
- Government / Local Government
/ Private Enterprise - Career Goal

13:28.370 --> 13:31.580
- Comments - ( 4 ) Write anything that
doesn't apply to the above 2 categories below.

13:29.976 --> 13:31.580
2nd choice

13:29.976 --> 13:31.580
School Name

13:29.976 --> 13:31.580
Comments

13:29.976 --> 13:31.580
3rd choice

13:30.480 --> 13:31.570
No...

13:33.670 --> 13:35.440
I don't know why, but...

13:36.080 --> 13:38.230
She seems to be really worried about this.

13:38.940 --> 13:40.240
I didn't notice.

13:40.930 --> 13:42.580
I didn't notice...

13:44.100 --> 13:47.910
Of course I didn't...
because Hori-san is always...

13:50.300 --> 13:52.640
I wish I could go out and
have fun once in a while.

13:53.750 --> 13:56.149
Of course I have fun
doing chores at home, but...

13:56.150 --> 13:58.320
It's complicated.

14:03.270 --> 14:05.350
How long were you gonna keep me waiting.

14:07.090 --> 14:08.240
Miyamura?

14:09.040 --> 14:10.040
Huh? What?

14:13.310 --> 14:14.310
Dummy.

14:20.210 --> 14:22.940
I knew all along, but never noticed.

14:23.920 --> 14:25.040
I'm sorry.

14:25.801 --> 14:28.300
- - I think I knew all along, but never noticed.
I'm sorry. I probably knew that you were crying.

14:28.620 --> 14:31.920
"I probably knew that you were crying."

14:32.540 --> 14:33.889
What's that supposed to mean?

14:33.890 --> 14:36.060
Me... crying?

14:37.510 --> 14:39.359
Was I crying?

14:39.360 --> 14:42.650
Miyamura... was I crying?

14:48.200 --> 14:49.460
Good job!

14:49.830 --> 14:53.030
The student council should have
been paying you for all that work.

14:53.560 --> 14:56.180
It wasn't a big deal.

14:57.010 --> 14:59.660
Oh, Miyamura. We started without you.

15:02.730 --> 15:07.990
Hori-san, I thought I lost
mine, but then I found it.

15:08.760 --> 15:10.480
Here's an extra. Do you need it?

15:12.710 --> 15:13.910
Y-Yes.

15:15.600 --> 15:17.629
Hori, would you like mine as well?

15:17.630 --> 15:19.169
No, this one's enough.

15:19.170 --> 15:20.729
I see.

15:20.730 --> 15:22.219
How'd you know?

15:22.220 --> 15:23.030
Know what?

15:23.030 --> 15:23.750
That I...

15:23.751 --> 15:25.259
Like I said, it's an extra.

15:25.260 --> 15:26.290
Extra...

15:27.180 --> 15:28.590
No way.

15:29.680 --> 15:30.950
Hori-san.

15:34.350 --> 15:36.400
Huh? I thought you finished helping them.

15:36.880 --> 15:38.759
Yeah. I wonder what it is.

15:38.760 --> 15:40.480
They told me everything was fine.

15:54.180 --> 15:58.160
Like I said, it's your fault that
we can't publish the results.

15:58.750 --> 16:02.969
But arranging the results wasn't
my job, it was Ayasaki-san's!

16:02.970 --> 16:04.899
So you intend to push the blame on Remi?

16:04.900 --> 16:06.719
You should do it properly.

16:06.720 --> 16:10.606
Just because you were helping us temporarily doesn't
mean you can get away with doing shoddy work.

16:10.630 --> 16:13.049
Eh? What's going on?

16:13.050 --> 16:14.870
Did Hori do something?

16:15.550 --> 16:18.979
Something about a miscalculation.

16:18.980 --> 16:20.060
She's a third-year student.

16:20.970 --> 16:21.970
Seriously?

16:22.160 --> 16:24.909
No way. I did it properly.

16:24.910 --> 16:27.280
Hori-san thinks she can get
away with doing shoddy work.

16:27.950 --> 16:29.669
Just because she's a little smart.

16:29.670 --> 16:30.860
She's in Class 1?

16:31.350 --> 16:33.239
So she was <i>that</i> kind of person?

16:33.240 --> 16:34.490
She's the worst!

16:36.220 --> 16:38.760
Apologize, Hori-san!

16:39.120 --> 16:39.790
Apologize!

16:39.791 --> 16:41.200
Yeah, apologize!

16:41.800 --> 16:43.970
Sengoku, you bastard!

16:44.170 --> 16:45.280
Calm down.

16:45.740 --> 16:49.280
Quit it! I saw with my own
eyes that she did it properly!

17:05.610 --> 17:07.609
H-Hey, Miyamura...

17:07.610 --> 17:11.310
Ishikawa-kun, hold on to
these for me for a second.

17:14.090 --> 17:15.090
Miyamura?

17:15.590 --> 17:16.590
What?

17:18.320 --> 17:20.090
President Sengoku...

17:24.000 --> 17:25.539
What is he doing?

17:25.540 --> 17:26.370
You'll be suspended!

17:26.371 --> 17:29.359
You'll be expelled! What do you
think you're doing to our president!

17:29.360 --> 17:30.360
Look.

17:31.110 --> 17:33.269
OK, people, move along.

17:33.270 --> 17:35.120
There's nothing to see here.

17:35.650 --> 17:39.040
Remi? What's going on?

17:48.960 --> 17:52.800
They should've remembered
to destroy the evidence.

17:53.600 --> 17:54.900
What's that?

17:55.680 --> 17:57.629
I found these in the garbage.

17:57.630 --> 17:59.149
I was looking for them.

17:59.150 --> 18:01.140
Good job finding them!

18:02.020 --> 18:04.720
Did you really need to headbutt him?

18:05.490 --> 18:10.610
W-Well... I was just pretty angry.

18:13.790 --> 18:14.799
Not bad at all.

18:14.800 --> 18:16.960
I understand that he's angry, but...

18:19.420 --> 18:21.440
Why does he always...

18:39.680 --> 18:41.469
OK. Time to run for it.

18:41.470 --> 18:43.970
Wait, Hori-san. Where's your umbrella?

18:44.310 --> 18:46.880
Miyamura! Where's <i>your</i> umbrella?

18:47.910 --> 18:49.290
Your umbrella.

18:53.980 --> 18:56.829
Wait a second. You'll get soaked.

18:56.830 --> 18:59.459
I'll go to the convienience
store and grab one.

18:59.460 --> 19:01.440
Don't worry about it. That'd be a waste.

19:03.730 --> 19:04.730
Then...

19:13.210 --> 19:14.210
Let's run.

19:16.580 --> 19:18.929
Wait up, Miyamura!

19:18.930 --> 19:22.510
Aren't you cold?! You're getting soaked!

19:24.140 --> 19:26.419
Hey, aren't you listening?!

19:26.420 --> 19:29.019
You're going to catch a
cold! Are you OK with that?

19:29.020 --> 19:30.709
Hey, Miyamura!

19:30.710 --> 19:33.139
Why'd you give me this?! Hey!

19:33.140 --> 19:34.529
Would you give it to just anyone?

19:34.530 --> 19:36.529
Why are you so nice?

19:36.530 --> 19:38.639
Why are you always so nice?!

19:38.640 --> 19:41.629
Why are you always here for me?

19:41.630 --> 19:45.660
Why are you... my...

20:12.540 --> 20:13.580
Dummy.

20:14.020 --> 20:16.250
Translator EmptySoul

20:14.660 --> 20:18.250
Word about Miyamura's
headbutt didn't really spread.

20:18.880 --> 20:23.060
So, Hori. Does Sengoku
have some dirt on you?

20:24.540 --> 20:27.120
No way... there's no way that could happen.

20:28.540 --> 20:30.320
Rock, paper, scissors!

20:31.950 --> 20:34.479
Is this full of lead?

20:34.480 --> 20:35.750
What?

20:36.350 --> 20:38.950
You mean my Japanese,
English, and Chinese dictionaries?

20:39.170 --> 20:41.400
Translation Check Meiko

20:42.070 --> 20:43.779
Kyou-chan, listen.

20:43.780 --> 20:46.129
I'm going to change
when I get into high school.

20:46.130 --> 20:47.170
Really?

20:47.550 --> 20:49.785
Timer EmptySoul

20:47.780 --> 20:51.719
I'm going to use my good grades to become
the student council president or something.

20:51.720 --> 20:53.749
You're going to Yasaka, right?

20:53.750 --> 20:55.000
Nope, Katagiri.

20:57.080 --> 20:59.850
What's wrong, Sengoku? What about you?

21:00.520 --> 21:02.000
Katagiri...

21:02.700 --> 21:03.820
Same school...

21:05.100 --> 21:06.640
Seriously?

21:05.780 --> 21:08.010
Typesetter Zegond

21:08.200 --> 21:10.860
When we start, just leave me alone!

21:11.500 --> 21:13.330
I'm through being your lap dog.

21:14.000 --> 21:16.230
Editor & Encoder Eternal_Blizzard

21:14.830 --> 21:16.800
You've been thinking of yourself as my dog?

21:17.400 --> 21:22.089
Um... Not really...
Dogs are cute.

21:22.090 --> 21:23.600
Then as a slave?

21:24.770 --> 21:29.100
Anyway, if you make fun of me,
then I'll tell everyone your secret!

21:29.470 --> 21:34.319
Oh? Like how I hate stew, but ate some
anyway once and threw up afterward?

21:34.320 --> 21:36.870
And now whenever I see stew,
I get a weird look on my face?

21:37.210 --> 21:41.620
Nope. Like how you beat
five guys in arm wrestling.

21:42.740 --> 21:44.679
Sengoku, you bastard...

21:44.680 --> 21:47.239
Ah! There it is! That attitude!

21:47.240 --> 21:48.870
It's so unappealing!

21:50.380 --> 21:52.639
Also don't forget the honorifics!

21:52.640 --> 21:53.679
Then what should I say?

21:53.680 --> 21:55.449
<i>The</i> Sengoku?

21:55.450 --> 21:57.070
Am I a movie?

22:00.550 --> 22:02.180
I used to bully him...

22:02.500 --> 22:04.985
Quality Check Live-Evil QC Team

22:03.300 --> 22:05.169
She used to bully me...

22:05.170 --> 22:06.670
I can't tell anyone.

22:09.160 --> 22:10.440
Ah. Good morning.

22:11.830 --> 22:14.320
G-G-G-Good morning!
